---
// DETAIL A — inside the memory store: one fact's life.
// Engineering-drawing DETAIL sheet under Plate II (a zoom into memory/sqlite.py):
// one facts-table row, drawn to scale, followed through its five-step life. The
// plate's heart is THE VISIBILITY LINE — a literal labeled horizontal line the
// above/below boxes respect: the injected block reads only conf ≥ 0.7 AND rs ≥ 0.2.
// Badges ①–⑤ ride the lifecycle rail: ① captured → ② staged → ③ folded →
// ④ promoted / decayed / superseded → ⑤ recalled (injected above the line, or
// searched below it). All box labels are source-true (memory/sqlite.py, gate.py,
// predictive_write_gate.py, consolidation.py, hierarchy.py — see DRAWING-SPEC).
// Single hue: mem (cyan) via @theme tokens (stroke-mem/fill-mem + /NN); no
// hardcoded colour. Square corners. Marker ids p5-*. SVG at sm+; FlowLedger below sm.
import FlowLedger from './FlowLedger.astro';
---

<figure
  role="img"
  aria-label="Detail A of the architecture drawing, a zoom into the memory store: one fact's life, numbered one to five. On the left, the record — a single facts-table row: key, value and provenance; confidence and retrieval strength; access_count with its staged twins; node_kind of fact, gist or schema; and status, active or superseded pointing at superseded_by. One active truth per key is enforced by a partial unique index. One: the fact is captured — gates write it at a confidence of point-five to point-six-nine, always below the visibility line. Two: it is staged — reads only bump its staged access counters. Three: it is folded — fold_staged_access runs only at a consolidation boundary. Four: its fate is decided — two or more episodes promote it to point-eight, which crosses the line; unused facts decay on a half-life to a floor of point-oh-five; cap-trim demotes but never deletes; and a new value supersedes the old, whose row stays. Every write is read back, raising MemoryVerifyError if it did not stick. The visibility line is the invariant at the heart of the store: the injected block reads only facts with confidence at least point-seven and retrieval strength at least point-two. Above the line sits the injected index — byte-stable between consolidations, scored by lh_slow_score at day granularity over folded columns only. Below the line sits staging — searchable but not steering, scored by lh_fused_score at hour granularity with BM25, which memory_search re-ranks freely. Five: the fact is recalled — injected if it is above the line, or found by search below it. On the right, the graph: edges of derived_from, member_of, supports and contradicts; gists route retrieval by a neighborhood breadth-first search of depth up to four but never inject themselves; and FTS5 quotes every token so operators stay literal."
>
  <!-- sm+: architectural DETAIL sheet -->
  <div class="hidden w-full lg:block" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1160 468" class="w-full">
