      <text x="46" y="34" class="fill-ink font-sans text-[15px] font-semibold">inside the memory store — one fact's life</text>
      <text x="46" y="58" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[9px]">DETAIL A · zoom into memory/sqlite.py · the fact's-eye view</text>

      <text x="1144" y="16" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8px]">LH-ARCH-001 · DETAIL A · OF PLATE II</text>
