      <text x="1144" y="38" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8px]">MILESTONE semanticization</text>
      <text x="1144" y="58" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[9px]">one facts-row · the visibility line · the lifecycle</text>

      <line x1="16" y1="76" x2="1144" y2="76" class="stroke-edge" stroke-width="1"></line>

